data: {"messages":[{"content":"请测试 `evidence-snapshot` skill 的 Agent 真链路。\n\n必须严格执行：\n1. 先调用 read_file 读取 `/mnt/skills/custom/evidence-snapshot/SKILL.md`。\n2. 再调用 bash 执行下面这段命令，不要改路径，不要省略任何输出文件。\n3. 执行完成后读取 `/mnt/user-data/outputs/evidence-snapshot/result.json`，并在最终回复中返回这个 JSON 的内容和简短结论。\n\n```bash\nmkdir -p /mnt/user-data/outputs/evidence-snapshot /mnt/user-data/workspace/evidence-snapshot\npython /mnt/skills/custom/frame-sampling/scripts/run.py --video /mnt/datasets/Vedio-demo/Trafic.mp4 --camera-id CAM_DEERFLOW_001 --capture-seconds 2 --interval-seconds 1 --output-dir /mnt/user-data/workspace/evidence-snapshot/frames --config /mnt/skills/custom/configs/deerflow_config.json --output /mnt/user-data/workspace/evidence-snapshot/frames.json\npython - <<'PY'\nimport json, pathlib\nevent = {\"event_id\":\"EVT_TEST_001\",\"event_type\":\"traffic_congestion\",\"camera_id\":\"CAM_DEERFLOW_001\",\"confidence\":0.8,\"evidence_frame_ids\":[\"CAM_DEERFLOW_001_000001\"]}\np = pathlib.Path('/mnt/user-data/workspace/evidence-snapshot/event.json')\np.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\njson.dump(event, p.open('w'), ensure_ascii=False, indent=2)\nPY\npython /mnt/skills/custom/evidence-snapshot/scripts/run.py --event-json /mnt/user-data/workspace/evidence-snapshot/event.json --frames-json /mnt/user-data/workspace/evidence-snapshot/frames.json --output-dir /mnt/user-data/outputs/evidence-snapshot/artifacts --config /mnt/skills/custom/configs/deerflow_config.json --output /mnt/user-data/outputs/evidence-snapshot/result.json\n```\n\n成功判定：必须能看到 read_file 读取该 SKILL.md、bash 执行该 skill 入口、并生成 `/mnt/user-data/outputs/evidence-snapshot/result.json`。","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"human","name":null,"id":"fb4453bf-de42-468d-8520-dcb6ae429bab"},{"content":"我将严格按照要求测试 `evidence-snapshot` skill 的完整链路。\n\n**步骤 1：读取 SKILL.md 文件**\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":138,"prompt_tokens":9253,"total_tokens":93